{"task_id": "Mbpp/2", "solution": "def similar_elements(list1: list, list2: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds and returns elements that are common to both input lists.\n    It returns a new list containing elements present in both list1 and list2.\n    \"\"\"\n    set1 = set(list1)\n    set2 = set(list2)\n    return list(set1.intersection(set2))"}
