{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "def sort_matrix(matrix: list[list[int | float]]) -> list[list[int | float]]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a matrix by the ascending sum of its rows.\n    Returns a new matrix with rows reordered based on their sums.\"\"\"\n\n    rows_with_sums = [(row, sum(row)) for row in matrix]\n    sorted_rows_with_sums = sorted(rows_with_sums, key=lambda item: item[1])\n    sorted_matrix = [row for row, _ in sorted_rows_with_sums]\n\n    return sorted_matrix"}
