{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals their length.\"\"\"\n    total_count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum_of_digits = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Calculate sum of digits for substring s[i:j+1]\n            current_sum_of_digits += int(s[j])\n\n            # Calculate length of substring s[i:j+1]\n            substring_length = j - i + 1\n\n            # Check if sum of digits equals length\n            if current_sum_of_digits == substring_length:\n                total_count += 1\n\n    return total_count"}
