{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "def recursive_list_sum(input_list: list) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a nested list structure and calculates the sum of all numerical elements.\n    It processes nested sub-lists recursively to create a single-level list before summing.\n    \"\"\"\n    flattened_result = []\n\n    def _flatten_list(nested_list, current_flattened_list):\n        \"\"\"\n        Recursively flattens a nested list into a single-level list.\n        It appends numbers directly and recurses for sub-lists.\n        \"\"\"\n        for item in nested_list:\n            if isinstance(item, list):\n                _flatten_list(item, current_flattened_list)\n            else:\n                current_flattened_list.append(item)\n\n    _flatten_list(input_list, flattened_result)\n\n    total_sum = sum(flattened_result)\n    return total_sum"}
