{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(strings: list[str], patterns: list[str]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a list of strings follows a given pattern array consistently.\n    Returns True if the strings follow the pattern sequence, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(strings) != len(patterns):\n        return False\n\n    string_to_pattern_map = {}\n    pattern_to_string_map = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(strings)):\n        s = strings[i]\n        p = patterns[i]\n\n        if s in string_to_pattern_map:\n            if string_to_pattern_map[s] != p:\n                return False\n        else:\n            if p in pattern_to_string_map:\n                return False\n\n            string_to_pattern_map[s] = p\n            pattern_to_string_map[p] = s\n\n    return True"}
