{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo: dict[int, int] = {}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the Nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    It uses memoization to optimize recursive calls.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        _memo[n] = 1\n        return 1\n\n    # P(n) = P(P(n - 1)) + P(n - P(n - 1))\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    term1 = sequence(p_n_minus_1)\n    term2 = sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n\n    result = term1 + term2\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
