{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements, including empty arrays.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_zeros = 0\n    num_non_zeros = 0\n\n    for element in arr:\n        if element == 0:\n            num_zeros += 1\n        else:\n            num_non_zeros += 1\n\n    if num_non_zeros == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(num_zeros) / num_non_zeros"}
