{"task_id": "Mbpp/166", "solution": "def _is_even(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given number is even.\"\"\"\n    return number % 2 == 0\ndef _xor_is_even(num1: int, num2: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determines if the XOR of two numbers is even based on their parities.\"\"\"\n    return _is_even(num1) == _is_even(num2)\ndef find_even_pair(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts pairs in a list whose bitwise XOR results in an even number.\"\"\"\n    n = len(numbers)\n    if n < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    even_xor_pairs_count = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if _xor_is_even(numbers[i], numbers[j]):\n                even_xor_pairs_count += 1\n    return even_xor_pairs_count"}
