{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in the given string.\n    The search advances by the length of 'std' upon a match.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    i = 0\n    substring = 'std'\n    substring_len = len(substring)\n    string_len = len(input_string)\n\n    while i <= string_len - substring_len:\n        if input_string[i:i + substring_len] == substring:\n            count += 1\n            i += substring_len\n        else:\n            i += 1\n    return count"}
