{"task_id": "Mbpp/255", "solution": "def combinations_colors(elements: list, n: int) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all combinations with repetition of elements from the input list\n    for a specified length n.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_combinations = []\n\n    def _generate_combinations_recursive(\n        current_combination: list,\n    ) -> None:\n        \"\"\"\n        Private helper for generating combinations with repetition recursively.\n        It builds combinations by iterating through all elements at each step.\n        \"\"\"\n        if len(current_combination) == n:\n            all_combinations.append(tuple(current_combination))\n            return\n\n        for element in elements:\n            current_combination.append(element)\n            _generate_combinations_recursive(current_combination)\n            current_combination.pop()\n\n    _generate_combinations_recursive([])\n    return all_combinations"}
