{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in an integer is less than or equal to the digit's value.\n    Returns True if this condition holds for all digits, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_number = str(number)\n    digit_counts = {}\n\n    # Populate digit frequencies using a dictionary (DigitFrequencyMap)\n    for char_digit in s_number:\n        digit = int(char_digit)\n        digit_counts[digit] = digit_counts.get(digit, 0) + 1\n\n    # Evaluate the digit frequencies against their numerical values\n    for digit, frequency in digit_counts.items():\n        if frequency > digit:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
