{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(list_of_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list with the maximum length from a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple (maximum length, first sub-list with that length).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_len = 0\n    longest_list = []\n\n    for sub_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_length = len(sub_list)\n        if current_length > max_len:\n            max_len = current_length\n            longest_list = sub_list\n\n    return (max_len, longest_list)"}
