{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number.\n    L(0)=2, L(1)=1, L(n)=L(n-1)+L(n-2) for n>1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize with L(0) and L(1)\n    a, b = 2, 1  # a represents L(k-2), b represents L(k-1)\n\n    # Iterate from L(2) up to L(n)\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        next_lucas = a + b\n        a = b\n        b = next_lucas\n    return b"}
