{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "def get_max_sum(n, _memo=None):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum for n using a specific recursive equation with memoization.\n    The function f(n) = max( (f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5)), n).\n    \"\"\"\n    if _memo is None:\n        _memo = {}\n\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    if n <= 1:\n        result = n\n    else:\n        sum_parts = (\n            get_max_sum(n // 2, _memo) +\n            get_max_sum(n // 3, _memo) +\n            get_max_sum(n // 4, _memo) +\n            get_max_sum(n // 5, _memo)\n        )\n        result = max(sum_parts, n)\n\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
