{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the total sum of digits for all numbers in the given list.\n\n    Args:\n        numbers: A list of integers.\n\n    Returns:\n        The total sum of digits for all numbers in the list.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        current_num_sum = 0\n        abs_num = abs(num)\n        if abs_num == 0:\n            current_num_sum = 0\n        else:\n            while abs_num > 0:\n                current_num_sum += abs_num % 10\n                abs_num //= 10\n        total_sum += current_num_sum\n    return total_sum"}
