{"task_id": "Mbpp/419", "solution": "def round_and_sum(numbers: list[float]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Rounds each number in the given list, calculates their sum,\n    and then multiplies the sum by the length of the original list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0.0\n\n    original_length = len(numbers)\n    rounded_sum = 0.0\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        rounded_sum += round(num)\n\n    final_product = rounded_sum * original_length\n    return final_product"}
