{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts an array using the Shell Sort algorithm in ascending order.\n\n    This function implements the Shell Sort algorithm using a gap reduction strategy.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n // 2\n\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            current_value = arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and arr[j - gap] > current_value:\n                arr[j] = arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            arr[j] = current_value\n        gap //= 2\n    return arr"}
