{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"Performs element-wise multiplication of corresponding elements within nested tuples.\n    Returns a new tuple of tuples with the products.\"\"\"\n\n    result_outer = []\n    # Iterate through the outer tuples, assuming they have compatible structures.\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        nested_tuple1 = tuple1[i]\n        nested_tuple2 = tuple2[i]\n\n        result_inner = []\n        # Iterate through the inner nested tuples, assuming they have compatible structures.\n        for j in range(len(nested_tuple1)):\n            product = nested_tuple1[j] * nested_tuple2[j]\n            result_inner.append(product)\n\n        result_outer.append(tuple(result_inner))\n\n    return tuple(result_outer)"}
