{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of tuple elements, handling nested structures recursively.\n    Assumes inputs are valid and corresponding elements are of compatible types.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_elements = []\n    for i in range(len(tuple1)):\n        elem1 = tuple1[i]\n        elem2 = tuple2[i]\n\n        if isinstance(elem1, tuple):\n            result_elements.append(index_multiplication(elem1, elem2))\n        else:\n            result_elements.append(elem1 * elem2)\n\n    return tuple(result_elements)"}
