{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n    It efficiently finds factors by iterating up to the square root of the number.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of the number (inclusive)\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            # If 'i' is a factor and is even, add it to the sum\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += i\n\n            # Calculate the complementary factor\n            other_factor = number // i\n\n            # If the complementary factor is different from 'i' (to avoid double counting for perfect squares)\n            # and is even, add it to the sum\n            if other_factor != i and other_factor % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += other_factor\n    return total_sum"}
