{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given positive integer.\n    Factors are checked efficiently by iterating up to the square root of the number.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_even_factors = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            factor1 = i\n            factor2 = number // i\n\n            if factor1 % 2 == 0:\n                sum_of_even_factors += factor1\n\n            if factor2 != factor1 and factor2 % 2 == 0:\n                sum_of_even_factors += factor2\n    return sum_of_even_factors"}
