{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(list_of_lists: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    Assumes input list_of_lists is not empty and contains only lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_sublist = list_of_lists[0]\n    min_length = len(list_of_lists[0])\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists[1:]:\n        if len(sublist) < min_length:\n            min_length = len(sublist)\n            min_sublist = sublist\n\n    return min_sublist"}
