{"task_id": "Mbpp/476", "solution": "def big_sum(arr: list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the largest and smallest values in the input array.\n    Assumes a non-empty array with numerical values.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_val = arr[0]\n    max_val = arr[0]\n\n    for x in arr[1:]:\n        if x < min_val:\n            min_val = x\n        if x > max_val:\n            max_val = x\n\n    return min_val + max_val"}
