{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes contiguous lowercase substrings from the input string.\n    Each sequence of lowercase characters is replaced by an empty string.\"\"\"\n\n    result_chars = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    while i < n:\n        char = input_string[i]\n        if char.isupper():\n            result_chars.append(char)\n            i += 1\n        else: # char is lowercase (or non-alphabetic, which will also be skipped)\n            # Skip all characters that are not uppercase.\n            # This effectively removes contiguous lowercase substrings.\n            while i < n and not input_string[i].isupper():\n                i += 1\n\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
