{"task_id": "Mbpp/560", "solution": "def union_elements(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the union of elements from two tuples and returns them sorted.\n    This function combines all unique elements from both input tuples into a single sorted tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    combined_elements = tuple1 + tuple2\n    unique_elements = set(combined_elements)\n    sorted_elements_list = sorted(list(unique_elements))\n    return tuple(sorted_elements_list)"}
