{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "import math\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients C(n, k) * C(n, k+1).\n    It first computes all binomial coefficients C(n, k) and then sums their consecutive products.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    binomial_coefficients_list = []\n\n    # Calculate all binomial coefficients C(n, k) for k from 0 to n\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        binomial_coefficients_list.append(math.comb(n, k))\n\n    # Calculate the product of consecutive coefficients and sum them\n    for k in range(n):\n        product = binomial_coefficients_list[k] * binomial_coefficients_list[k+1]\n        total_sum += product\n\n    return total_sum"}
