{"task_id": "Mbpp/608", "solution": "def _combinations(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates binomial coefficient (n choose k).\n    It computes n! / (k! * (n-k)!) efficiently.\"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\ndef bell_Number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the nth Bell number using dynamic programming.\n    It applies the recurrence B(n+1) = sum(k=0 to n) of (n choose k) * B(k).\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    bell = [0] * (n + 1)\n    bell[0] = 1\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_bell_sum = 0\n        for k in range(i + 1):\n            current_bell_sum += _combinations(i, k) * bell[k]\n        bell[i + 1] = current_bell_sum\n\n    return bell[n]"}
