{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "def replace_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Replaces whitespace characters with underscores, or vice-versa, based on string content.\n    Returns original string if both or neither character types are present.\"\"\"\n    has_whitespaces = False\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char.isspace():\n            has_whitespaces = True\n            break\n\n    has_underscores = '_' in input_string\n\n    if has_whitespaces and not has_underscores:\n        transformed_string_list = []\n        for char in input_string:\n            if char.isspace():\n                transformed_string_list.append('_')\n            else:\n                transformed_string_list.append(char)\n        return \"\".join(transformed_string_list)\n    elif not has_whitespaces and has_underscores:\n        return input_string.replace('_', ' ')\n    else:\n        return input_string"}
