{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity: float, temperature: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index based on wind velocity (km/h) and temperature (Celsius).\n    The result is rounded up to the next integer as per the design.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Standard formula for wind chill index using wind velocity in km/h and temperature in Celsius.\n    # WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215T - 11.37V^0.16 + 0.3965T V^0.16\n\n    # Pre-calculate V^0.16 for efficiency.\n    v_power_0_16 = wind_velocity ** 0.16\n\n    # Compute the raw wind chill index.\n    wind_chill_raw = (13.12 +\n                      (0.6215 * temperature) -\n                      (11.37 * v_power_0_16) +\n                      (0.3965 * temperature * v_power_0_16))\n\n    # Round the calculated index up to the next whole integer.\n    return math.ceil(wind_chill_raw)"}
