{"task_id": "Mbpp/724", "solution": "def power_base_sum(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all digits of a given base raised to a specified power.\n    Leverages Python's arbitrary-precision integers for large results.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Calculate base raised to power\n    exponentiated_value = base ** power\n\n    # Convert the large number to a string to easily access its digits\n    str_value = str(exponentiated_value)\n\n    # Sum the individual digits\n    sum_of_digits = 0\n    for digit_char in str_value:\n        sum_of_digits += int(digit_char)\n\n    return sum_of_digits"}
