{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(array: tuple[int, ...], length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in the array.\n    The array is sorted to efficiently find the minimum difference between adjacent elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    # Sort the array to facilitate finding the minimum difference.\n    sorted_array = sorted(array)\n\n    for i in range(length - 1):\n        # Calculate difference between adjacent elements and update min_diff.\n        current_diff = abs(sorted_array[i] - sorted_array[i+1])\n        if current_diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = current_diff\n\n    return int(min_diff)"}
