{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(arr: list, element: any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the last position of an element in a sorted array.\n    Returns the zero-based index or -1 if the element is not found.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == element:\n            result = mid  # Found a potential last occurrence\n            low = mid + 1  # Try to find an even later occurrence in the right half\n        elif arr[mid] < element:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # arr[mid] > element\n            high = mid - 1\n\n    return result"}
