{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within an inclusive range [l, r].\n    Returns 0 if the range is invalid or contains no qualifying numbers.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_natural(number: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is a natural number (positive integer).\"\"\"\n        return number >= 1\n\n    def _is_odd(number: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is odd (not divisible by 2).\"\"\"\n        return number % 2 != 0\n\n    if l > r:\n        return 0\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for x in range(l, r + 1):\n        if _is_natural(x) and _is_odd(x):\n            current_sum += x\n\n    return current_sum"}
